; A `)` closing a `[`. REFUSED: either the opener or the closer is the typo, the file

; reads either way once changed, and only the author knows which was meant. A tool
; that picks one has a 50% chance of rewriting a binding vector into a call.
(module balance-mismatched-bracket)

(defn bad-binding [] (-> i64)
  (let [x 1]
    x))
